UC14 ..> UC15 : <<include>>

' ===== NOTES =====
note right of Staff
  **Primary Role:**
  - Report data quality issues
  - Upload files for validation
  - Track issue progress
  - View personal dashboard
end note

note right of HOD
  **Primary Role:**
  - Manage department issues
  - Assign work to staff
  - Generate reports
  - Monitor department performance
end note

note right of Admin
  **Primary Role:**
  - System-wide management
  - User administration
  - Access all features
  - View analytics
end note

note bottom of "DQIMS Platform"
  **System Flow:**
  Staff Reports Issue → HOD Assigns → Staff Resolves → HOD Closes → System Audits
  
  **Data Validation Flow:**
  Upload File → Validate → Review Errors → Export Results → Track History
end note

@enduml
